{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-tu2ye_qiandao",
  "id": "source-35025",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35025001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "绯野原爱、葵、贝歌身着盛装，再次出现在大家的面前——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "现在是专属于我们的「ShowTime」，是不是感觉全身的每个细胞都兴奋了起来？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "唔，我只想快点完成演出……这样就可以去睡觉了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "愿我的歌声能陪伴在场的每一位，于今夜进入安眠的梦乡。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哇哦，原来这就是你们辛苦准备了这么久的超级大惊喜~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好极了，「兔儿爷」也一起来欣赏吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "呵呵，我很荣幸哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "那么，一起深呼吸，我们这就开始吧——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "「当我醒来发现我能动动身体。」♫♪……♫♬♪",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "「黑暗中等待你唤醒我的力量。」……♫♬♪",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "「你的热爱就是照亮我世界的光芒。」……♫♬♪",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "「一心为你我们早已准备入场。」……♫♬♪",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "「这次奇妙之旅轮到我来出场。」……♫♬♪",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "「偷偷看你模样我在抬头仰望。」……♫♬♪",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "葵",
          "text": "唔呣，随着水母自在地摇摆，坠入美好的梦中吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "你让我明白，我的歌声也可以让人遗忘忧伤。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "谢谢你。我会珍惜这份礼物，珍惜与你的羁绊......\n直至生命的终结。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "这场演出你还满意吗，|101|？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025019",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "这是为你而精心准备的华丽，其名为——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35025020",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "「深海幽梦之歌」",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "noticeKind": "video",
          "sourceId": "35025021",
          "sourceType": 11,
          "text": "此处为游戏视频演出，尚未转写为文字。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
